s I can no longer recommend the full release of this game.  It went from amazing, to frustrating to now just bad (at least compared to what it use to be) and this isn't just because of the difficulty, it is the change from the original fair difficulty where I was ending the game on the hardest possible difficulty setting to now unable to pass a certain boss due to some bad decisions in the development process.  I use to recommend this game while it was early access and I paid full price because I loved the gameplay but now I cannot.  was once good but is now a mediocre game.", "timestamp_created": 1712483448, "timestamp_updated": 1712483448, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.427603065967559814", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "162395581", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020045934", "personaname": "Monarch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dixout4griffith/", "num_games_owned": 466, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 5356, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 60, "last_played": 1737297368, "avatar": "9870bbd076aa1a14d4ac2b4371a84770eb8a686b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing FPS, terrible Roguelike.", "timestamp_created": 1712477478, "timestamp_updated": 1713005054, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "162384364", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096458459", "personaname": "Queen Amoeba", "persona_status": "offline", "pro